o `dc:creator GitHub Copilot` and make it clear only to use this when creating new terms \\n\\n\\n**Another problem**\\n- Co-pilot only looks at CL ids in the cl-edit file when generating a new ID (so does not take into account Ids assigned in open PRs) - This has been fixed by Damien's implementation\\n\\n\\n\",\n  \"comments\": [],\n  \"title\": \"Update claude.md instructions for GitHub Copilot\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3267\"\n}","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"__issue_context__.json","time":{"start":1778377722977,"end":1778377723072}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_04c36dbdbbc868e60169ffe3fae0cc81a2a8348f1c4a2a0aad"}},"id":"prt_e0f928c280012q89klVIppEYma","sessionID":"ses_1f06d81bcffepJaNZGkx7dgphE","messageID":"msg_e0f927f06001H728CNNw3vJr0T"}}
